      "$description": "Typography roles at the role scale (sizes in px = pt). Standard weights: 300 (only at ≥ 20 px), 400, 500; nothing heavier outside Bold Text. Thin weights (100–200) exist only as a metric role's darkWeight at ≥ 34 px. The build derives the dark, Increase Contrast (floor 400) and Bold Text weights (ADR-0021).",
